  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Parental and community empowerment to ensure the best start in life for every girl and boy:Caregivers know the range and
benefit of services available for antenatal, childbirth and young child survival, are empowered to provide stimulating and
responsive care for their children, and have access to and use preventive and curative care</narrative>
